{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/cavaliers-of-mars/1341494-question-about-the-future-of-cavaliers-of-mars","id":1341494,"title":"Question about the future of Cavaliers of Mars","path":["Home","Onyx Path","Partner Worlds","Cavaliers of Mars"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-15T12:38:18-07:00","id":1341494,"title":"Question about the future of Cavaliers of Mars","content":"After releasing all the Kickstarter rewards there is something planned for Cavaliers of Mars? A book about venus maybe?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","name":"Starkiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-15T12:56:36-07:00","id":1341497,"title":"","content":"That's... pretty much up to Rose at this point. While it sounded like she has ideas for more books, it's unclear if any are really going to get turned into books any time soon. She does a lot of work on different projects, and there's no need for CoM to get pressured into a supplement treadmill for attention. I don't feel the intent was for CoM to ever turn into a large catalogue sort of property, even if I hope Rose does return to it once and awhile.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-18T10:48:25-07:00","id":1342120,"title":"","content":"There will be more materials for <i>Cavaliers</i>. After <i>City of the Towered Tombs</i> is published, I'll talk more about them.<br /> <br /> On the subject of Venus, I've been making notes...<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Travel now to primeval Venus in its greatest age of discovery. A world of clashing blades and eternal twilight, of jeweled queens and forgotten gods. Where ships made from the hollowed bones of great serpents sail storm-tossed seas. Where mushroom jungles conceal the stony tombs of the Spectre Kings. Where the nations of a thousand archipelagos vie for the riches of the World Ocean.</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Find yourself striding the deck of a mighty galleon, escaping from the puzzle-prison of mad Oone, diving the sunken streets and treasure-houses of lost Lemuria. Sail boldly against the armada of the Golden Prince, carrying at your side a cutlass of sharpest glass.</i></span></span><br /> <br /> <span style=\"color:#000000\"><span style=\"font-family:Arial\"><i>Voyage, explore, and thrive on Venus, a world of great beasts and drowned moons, of rending loss and fierce romance.<br /> <br /> <b>Corsairs of Venus</b></i></span></span> </div> </div> </div>And there's a bit more in <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/289118/WitchQueen-of-the-Shadowed-Citadel?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Witch-Queen of the Shadowed Citadel</a>!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":8}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-19T09:18:16-07:00","id":1342355,"title":"","content":"Thanks for this awesome news, I really liked Cavaliers of Mars and can\u2019t wait to know more about this line of rpg.<br /> Btw I am a backer of the Kickstarter and I really like the material published thanks to it.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":5811,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","user":"Starkiller","date":". 10-19-2019, 12:20 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/5811-starkiller","name":"Starkiller","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Apr 2015"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"47"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-20T07:15:09-07:00","id":1342521,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Starkiller</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/partner-worlds/cavaliers-of-mars/1341494-question-about-the-future-of-cavaliers-of-mars?p=1342355#post1342355\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <