oons, of rending loss and fierce romance.<br /> <br /> <b>Corsairs of Venus&quot;</b></span></span></i></span></span><br /> <br /> <br /> And there's a bit more in <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/product/289118/WitchQueen-of-the-Shadowed-Citadel?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Witch-Queen of the Shadowed Citadel</a>!</div> </div> </div> </div>Gearing up for a Cavaliers of Mars game, so I've been checking out the forum for any Cavaliers posts. I ran into this older post from, first I've seen it. Corsairs of Venus! Wow, sounds Epic!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><span style=\"font-family:georgia\">Organizer for the Dead Gamers Society: The So Cal World of Darkness Meetup. </span><a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\">http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/85-drumheller","name":"Drumheller","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar85_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"55"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}